}\nwhere UMI counts are the raw molecular counts, library size is the total UMI count per cell, and the plus one prevents log of zero.\n\n\\subsection{Clustering}\nClustering was performed using Leiden algorithm with resolution selection based on silhouette score optimization. Random gene controls (19 total) were used for baseline comparison."},{"key":"write_file:224678f6bd845445c336f7d9ca3afa64f38660aef91a1d8835716c4b6675a059","call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9bf73defb1fed4b5","session":"C:\\Users\\User\\Desktop\\agentic\\workflow_codex\\.runtime\\codex-home\\sessions\\2026\\09\\13\\rollout-2026-09-13T23-08-39-0b785373-9b3.jsonl","timestamp":"2026-09-13T23:06:12.345Z","result":"Wrote 6476 bytes to report\\main.tex"},{"key":"build_research_report:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a:190","call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-969ae5b1515239be","session":"C:\\Users\\User\\Desktop\\agentic\\workflow_codex\\.runtime\\codex-home\\sessions\\2026\\09\\13\\rollout-2026-09-13T23-08-39-0b785373-9b3.jsonl","timestamp":"2026-09-13T23:06:20.110Z","result":"ERROR: {\"error\": \"pdflatex pass 1 failed with exit code 1:\\nThis is pdfTeX, Version 3.141592653-2.6-1.40.29 (MiKTeX 26.5) (preloaded format=pdflatex.fmt)\\n restricted \\\\write18 enabled.\\nentering extended mode\\n(main.tex\\nLaTeX2e <2026-06-01>\\nL3 programming layer <2026-06-18>\\n(C:\\\\Program Files\\\\MiKTeX\\\\tex/latex/base\\\\article.cls\\nDocument Class: article 2025/01/22 v1.4n Standard LaTeX document class\\n(C:\\\\Program Files\\\\MiKTeX\\\\tex/latex/base\\\\size11.clo))\\n(C:\\\\Program Files\\\\MiKTeX\\\\tex/latex/base\\\\inputenc.sty)\\n(C:\\\\Users\\\\User\\\\AppData\\\\Roaming\\\\MiKTeX\\\\tex/latex/booktabs\\\\booktabs.sty)\\n(C:\\\\Program Files\\\\MiKTeX\\\\tex/latex/graphics\\\\graphicx.sty\\n(C:\\\\Program Files\\\\MiKTeX\\\\tex/latex/graphics\\\\keyval.sty)\\n(C:\\\\Program Files\\\\MiKTeX\\\\tex/latex/graphics\\\\graphics.sty\\n(C:\\\\Program Files\\\\MiKTeX\\\\tex/latex/graphics\\\\trig.s